  "topic": "Booking rules",
  "quote": "full refund of the equipment booking fee. Cancellations less than 24 hours before the session start receive no refund. Exactly 24 hours before the session qualifies for a full refund. If the workshop cancels a session because equipment is unavailable, it refunds the full equipment booking fee regardless of notice. Refunds return to the original payment method within five working days. Membership fees and purchased materials are not refunded under this booking policy."
